                                                "sense_id": "6a70f2e2-d44c-3b20-9e58-b82e164c163a",
                                                "text": "Chelsea survived and can now turn their attentions to the Champions League final against Bayern Munich in Germany later this month as they face an increasingly arduous task to finish in the Premier League's top four."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
